----:|---------------------|---------------------|------------------------\r\nFrametime | 806 FPS (1.24 mspf) | 604 FPS (1.65 mspf) | 410 FPS (2.44 mspf)\r\n CPU Time | 8757 FPS (0.11 mspf) | 5847 FPS (0.17 mspf) | 4504 FPS (0.22 mspf)\r\n GPU Time | 847 FPS (1.18 mspf) | 638 FPS (1.57 mspf) | 434 FPS (2.30 mspf)\r\n\r\n#### After\r\n\r\n&nbsp;    | Average             | 1% low              | 0.1% low\r\n---------:|---------------------|---------------------|------------------------\r\nFrametime | 810 FPS (1.23 mspf) | 626 FPS (1.60 mspf) | 424 FPS (2.35 mspf)\r\n CPU Time | 7704 FPS (0.13 mspf) | 5434 FPS (0.18 mspf) | 4255 FPS (0.23 mspf)\r\n GPU Time | 850 FPS (1.18 mspf) | 654 FPS (1.53 mspf) | 436 FPS (2.29 mspf)\r\n\r\n### Mobile\r\n\r\n#### Before\r\n\r\n&nbsp;    | Average             | 1% low              | 0.1% low\r\n---------:|---------------------|---------------------|------------------------\r\nFrametime | 2334 FPS (0.43 mspf) | 1754 FPS (0.57 mspf) | 1464 FPS (0.68 mspf)\r\n CPU Time | 19016 FPS (0.05 mspf) | 11764 FPS (0.09 mspf) | 8695 FPS (0.12 mspf)\r\n GPU Time | 2645 FPS (0.38 mspf) | 1960 FPS (0.51 mspf) | 1647 FPS (0.61 mspf)\r\n\r\n#### After\r\n\r\n&nbsp;    | Average             | 1% low              | 0.1% low\r\n---------:|---------------------|---------------------|------------------------\r\nFrametime | 2367 FPS (0.42 mspf) | 1773 FPS (0.56 mspf) | 1497 FPS (0.67 mspf)\r\n CPU Time | 17433 FPS (0.06 mspf) | 11363 FPS (0.09 mspf) | 8620 FPS (0.12 mspf)\r\n GPU Time | 2693 FPS (0.37 mspf) | 1984 FPS (0.50 mspf) | 1686 FPS (0.59 mspf)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103779#pullrequestreview-2691573569","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103779","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-17T18:06:17Z"},{"id":2691577471,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gbjZ_","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"7f6df754ad91b4ffde4a81da72c6aa9ca5d413ef","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false